    "text": "Facebook X Bluesky Luchasarus shows up on the Zero Hour. One of the matches that took place during the Zero Hour pre-show for AEW’s Revolution pay-per-view was the 21-man Blackjack Battle Royal for the AEW National Championship. As the entrances were happening, cameras cut backstage to a bus pulling up to the arena, with Luchasaurus driving it. He was dropping off Jack Perry to compete in the bout. Luchasaurus has been out of action since December 2025. He was written off television by way of The Demand (Ricochet, Bishop Kaun & Toa Liona) targeting his shoulder. Fightful Select reported that Luchasaurus was dealing with a legitimate shoulder injury. He had his shoulder wrapped when he dropped Perry off. TagsAEW aew revolution Luchasaurus Andrew ThompsonMarch 15, 2026, 7:50 pm Facebook X Bluesky Share Facebook X Bluesky Willow Nightingale Retains AEW TBS Title At AEW Revolution Willow Nightingale Retains AEW TBS Title At AEW Revolution Andrade El Idolo Announced For ACW Reckoning Andrade El Idolo Announced For ACW Reckoning Related Articles Kenny Omega/MJF Contract Signing, Will Ospreay vs. PAC Set For 4/1 AEW Dynamite March 25, 2026, 10:10 pm AEW Women’s Tag Title Match, Ace Austin vs. Tommaso Ciampa Set For 3/28 AEW Collision March 25, 2026, 10:07 pm Two Bouts Confirmed For Josh Barnett’s Bloodsport XV March 25, 2026, 9:56 pm WWE EVOLVE Results (3/25): Future Of EVOLVE Women’s Title Decided March 25, 2026, 9:49 pm Sponsored Content Check Also Close WWE EVOLVE Results (3/25): Future Of EVOLVE Women’s Title Decided March 25, 2026, 9:49 pm LATEST WRESTLING PODCAST LATEST THE HUMP LATEST FIGHTFUL OVERBOOKED RESULTS WWE EVOLVE Results (3/25): Future Of EVOLVE Women’s Title Decided March 25, 2026 AEW Dynamite Results (3/25/2026): Swerve Strickland vs. Kenny Omega 2, THEKLA vs. Mina Shirakawa, MJF Appears, More March 25, 2026 NJPW Academy 3rd Anniversary Showcase Results (3/21): Steven Borden Competes March 25, 2026 CMLL Martes de Arena Mexico Results (3/24/2